  <!-- ===================================================== -->
  <section id="s13">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-num">13</div>
      <div>
        <div class="section-title">What <em>working together</em> looks like.</div>
        <p class="section-dek">Two modes. A 90-day shape. How outcomes get measured. No price on this slide &mdash; that&rsquo;s a conversation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="offer-modes">
      <div class="offer-mode">
        <div class="om-label">Mode 1</div>
        <div class="om-mode">Workshop<span class="om-sub">knowledge work &middot; days</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>remap one stream with your team</li>
          <li>agree the hooks together</li>
          <li>define what gets measured</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-mode">
        <div class="om-label">Mode 2</div>
        <div class="om-mode">Embedded<span class="om-sub">outsourced work &middot; weeks</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>~3 days/week in your standups</li>
          <li>instrument the hooks across your stack</li>
          <li>run the loop with one team &middot; handoff at the end</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="offer-timeline">
      <div class="ot-heading">90-day shape <em>(illustrative)</em></div>
      <div class="ot-row">
        <div class="ot-week">Week 1</div>
        <div class="ot-phase">Workshop</div>
        <div class="ot-what">remap one stream &middot; agree hooks &middot; define what gets measured</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ot-row">
        <div class="ot-week">Weeks 2&ndash;12</div>
        <div class="ot-phase">Embedded</div>
        <div class="ot-what">instrument hooks across your delivery stack &middot; run the loop with one team</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ot-row">
        <div class="ot-week">Week 13</div>
        <div class="ot-phase">Handoff</div>
        <div class="ot-what">metrics live in your tools, owned by your team</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="offer-measure"><strong>Outcomes measured by:</strong></p>
    <ul class="offer-measure-list">
      <li>Lead time idea-to-production <em>(leading)</em></li>
      <li>Quality: incident rate, time to recovery <em>(leading)</em></li>
      <li>% features generating revenue <em>(lagging, 12-month window)</em></li>
